    {
        "Id": 68,
        "ActionId": 68,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Ishmael",
            "That memory's important, sure. But it's only part of the reason. As for the rest... I think it has something to do with realizing that sunsets always end.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 69,
        "ActionId": 69,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "End?",
            70
