        "ActionId": 77,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The last streak of crimson sinks beneath the horizon. Night falls slowly, like ink spilling across the sky. The light fades from her eyes, leaving only a quiet calm, deep and still as the ocean."
